<view class="page"><demo-banner/><view class="eyebrow">KEEP IN TOUCH</view><view class="title">消息</view><view class="subtitle">每一件小事，都有回应。</view><view class="section-title">我的会话</view><view class="card row" wx:for="{{items}}" wx:key="_id" data-id="{{item._id}}" bindtap="open"><view class="avatar">聊</view><view class="grow"><view class="row"><text>{{item.customerName}}</text><text class="meta">{{item.time}}</text></view><view class="muted truncate">{{item.lastText || '开始你们的第一句对话'}}</view></view><view class="dot" wx:if="{{item.unread}}"></view></view><view class="empty" wx:if="{{!loading && !items.length && !isAdmin}}">还没有会话<view></view>在首页联系门店，或在工作台联系客户。</view><view class="card" wx:if="{{isAdmin}}">管理员可在管理中心查阅会话记录。<button class="secondary" bindtap="admin">管理中心</button></view><view class="loading" wx:if="{{loading}}">正在加载…</view><view class="error" wx:if="{{error}}">{{error}}</view><button wx:if="{{more}}" class="secondary" bindtap="load">加载更多</button><view class="meta">页面打开时自动刷新消息。</view></view>